<script>
  // First-run installer. Shown only while the users table is empty (the
  // middleware redirects away /admin/setup afterwards).
  let session = $data(() => __rvLoad("admin.session", {}));
</script>

<head>
  <title>安装 - oboext</title>
</head>

<div class="adm-auth">
  <div class="adm-auth-side">
    <div class="adm-auth-brand"><span class="adm-auth-mark">O</span> oboext 安装程序</div>
    <div>
      <h1>创建管理员账号</h1>
      <p>再差一步就完成了。设置第一个管理员账号（拥有全部权限），安装完成后会自动登录并进入仪表盘。</p>
      <ul>
        <li>数据库已自动迁移（本地 PGlite / 生产 Postgres）</li>
        <li>会话密钥自动生成于 .data/.auth-secret</li>
        <li>生产环境请设置环境变量 AUTH_SECRET</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="adm-hint">oboext on rosefd</div>
  </div>
  <div class="adm-auth-main">
    <div class="adm-auth-card">
      <div class="adm-steps"><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i></div>
      <h2>管理员信息</h2>
      <p class="adm-auth-sub">请妥善保管登录凭据</p>
      <form data-adm-form="setup">
        <div class="adm-field">
          <label>邮箱</label>
          <input class="adm-input" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required autofocus>
        </div>
        <div class="adm-field">
          <label>昵称</label>
          <input class="adm-input" name="name" autocomplete="nickname" required>
        </div>
        <div class="adm-field">
          <label>密码（至少 6 位）</label>
          <input class="adm-input" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="6" required>
        </div>
        <button class="adm-btn adm-btn-block" type="submit">完成安装</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
